UnitVotingRewardsManager::EarnedFees
├── when the estimate does not reach the latest checkpoint
│   └── it should return only the settled rewards
└── when the estimate reaches the latest checkpoint
    ├── when the stake has no weight
    │   └── it should return only the settled rewards
    └── when the stake has weight
        ├── when there are no pending fees
        │   ├── when the buffer is empty
        │   │   └── it should return only the settled rewards
        │   └── when the buffer is not empty
        │       ├── when the gauge is not active
        │       │   └── it should return only the settled rewards
        │       └── when the gauge is active
        │           ├── when the active buffer estimate is known
        │           │   └── it should add the buffered fee estimate
        │           └── when the active buffer estimate varies
        │               └── it should add the buffered fee estimate
        └── when there are pending fees
            ├── when the total supply is zero
            │   └── it should return only the settled rewards
            └── when the total supply is not zero
                ├── when the stake weight is permanent
                │   ├── when the full weight estimate varies
                │   │   └── it should add the pending fee estimate using the full weight
                │   ├── when the full weight estimate is known
                │   │   └── it should add the pending fee estimate using the full weight
                │   └── when the buffered and settled amounts are known
                │       └── it should add the buffered and settled fees to the pending estimate
                └── when the stake weight is decaying
                    ├── when the decayed weight estimate varies
                    │   └── it should add the pending fee estimate using the decayed weight
                    └── when the decayed weight estimate is known
                        └── it should add the pending fee estimate using the decayed weight
